 &lt;a class=&quot;hs-featured-image-link&quot; href=&quot;https://blog.pcisecuritystandards.org/payment-security-resources-for-merchants&quot; title=&quot;&quot;&gt; &lt;img alt=&quot;Payment Security Resources for Merchants&quot; class=&quot;hs-featured-image&quot; src=&quot;https://blog.pcisecuritystandards.org/hubfs/2026-blog/merchant-blog.jpg&quot; style=&quot;width: auto !important; float: left; margin: 0 15px 15px 0;&quot; /&gt; &lt;/a&gt; 
&lt;/div&gt; 
&lt;br /&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;Payment security doesn’t have to be complicated for merchants. Small, practical actions can make a meaningful difference in protecting payment data. PCI SSC provides practical resources to help merchants get started. With a strong data security foundation you can protect your customer payment data and prevent data breaches that can put you out of business. A strong data security foundation starts with people, process and technology.&lt;/p&gt;
